@startuml c1-system-context
title School Guardian — System Context (C4 L1)
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Acudiente" as Guardian
actor "Conductor" as Driver
actor "Administrador\ndel colegio" as SchoolAdmin
actor "Superadministrador" as SuperAdmin
cloud "Dispositivo / proveedor GPS" as GpsProvider
rectangle "School Guardian\nPlataforma de transporte escolar" as System
rectangle "Proveedor de notificaciones\nExpo Push / SMTP / Twilio" as Notifications
rectangle "Servicio de mapas\nOSRM / geocodificación" as Maps

Guardian --> System : Consulta ruta y recibe alertas
Driver --> System : Inicia recorrido, escanea QR\ny reporta incidentes
SchoolAdmin --> System : Administra colegio, usuarios\ny operación
SuperAdmin --> System : Administra la plataforma
GpsProvider --> System : Envía posiciones GPS
System --> Notifications : Envía notificaciones
System --> Maps : Solicita información de rutas

note bottom of System
  Fuente: 05-architecture/overview.md,
  deployment.md y service-catalog.md.
end note
@enduml
